OL,3,AShould I get a flu vaccine now?
OL,4,
OL,5,FHealth officials are urging more people
OL,6,Fto take up the offer of a free flu
OL,7,Fvaccine as the number of hospital
OL,8,Fpatients seriously ill with the virus
OL,9,Fhas risen sharply in the past week.
OL,11,FThe flu surge has come slightly early
OL,12,Fthis year but that is not completely
OL,13,Funusual.
OL,15,FFlu activity is still at "moderate
OL,16,Flevels" and the peak may not arrive
OL,17,Funtil December or early January, health
OL,18,Fofficials warn.
OL,20,FSo what is the advice on getting a
OL,21,Fvaccine, who can get it for free and
OL,22,Fwho should pay?
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
